Invokes the Sun to cause a flare within radius [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)], blinding your foes for 4 turns and lighting up the area.

All enemies effected will take [153, 205, 246, 281, 312 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage.

At talent level 3 you gain [28%, 38%, 46%, 52%, 58% (TL1-5; SP 100)] light, darkness, and fire resistance for 4 turns.

The damage done and resistances will increase with your Spellpower.
